zΔ⚡b|+{{About%7Cthe file comparison utility%7Cdata comparisons in general%7Cdata comparison%7Cdiffs in Wikipedia%7C:help:diff%7Cother uses%7CDIFF (disambiguation){{!}}DIFF}}%0A|=1d|+[[|=9|+]]|=27|+[[|=f|+]]|=4d|+[[|=d|+]]|=70|+[[|=14|+]]|=32c|+[[|=4|+]]|=220|+[[|=9|+]]|=7c|+[[|=f|+]]|=80|+<ref name%3D"diff paper">{{cite journal%7Cauthor1%3DJames W. Hunt %7Cauthor2%3DM. Douglas McIlroy %7Ctitle%3DAn Algorithm for Differential File Comparison%7Cvolume%3D41%7Cjournal%3DComputing Science Technical Report, Bell Laboratories%7Cdate%3DJune 1976%7Cpages%3D%7Curl%3Dhttp://www.cs.dartmouth.edu/~doug/diff.pdf}}</ref>|=38|+[[|=18|+]]|=31|+[[Stephen C. Johnson%7C|=d|+]]|=19|+[[|=5|+]]|=5|+[[|=9|+]]|=f1|+[[|=9|+]]|=194|+[[|=a|+]]|=11|+[[|=e|+]]|=43|+[[|=2|+ (Unix)%7Ced]]|=8c7|+[[|=1a|+]]|=cd|+[[|=22|+]]|=17|-7|=1|-85|=1|-7a|=6ed|+{{Col%2Dbegin}}%0A{{Col%2Dbreak%7Cwidth%3D33%25}}%0A''original'':%0A<source lang%3D"text" line>%0AThis part of the%0Adocument has stayed the%0Asame from version to%0Aversion.  It shouldn't%0Abe shown if it doesn't%0Achange.  Otherwise, that%0Awould not be helping to%0Acompress the size of the%0Achanges.%0A%0AThis paragraph contains%0Atext that is outdated.%0AIt will be deleted in the%0Anear future.%0A%0AIt is important to spell%0Acheck this dokument. On%0Athe other hand, a%0Amisspelled word isn't%0Athe end of the world.%0ANothing in the rest of%0Athis paragraph needs to%0Abe changed. Things can%0Abe added after it.%0A</source>%0A{{col%2Dbreak}}%0A''new'':%0A<source lang%3D"text" line>%0AThis is an important%0Anotice! It should%0Atherefore be located at%0Athe beginning of this%0Adocument!%0A%0AThis part of the%0Adocument has stayed the%0Asame from version to%0Aversion.  It shouldn't%0Abe shown if it doesn't%0Achange.  Otherwise, that%0Awould not be helping to%0Acompress anything.%0A%0AIt is important to spell%0Acheck this document. On%0Athe other hand, a%0Amisspelled word isn't%0Athe end of the world.%0ANothing in the rest of%0Athis paragraph needs to%0Abe changed. Things can%0Abe added after it.%0A%0AThis paragraph contains%0Aimportant new additions%0Ato this document.%0A</source>%0A{{col%2Dbreak%7Cwidth%3D33%25}}%0AThe command '''<tt>diff original new</tt>''' produces the following ''normal diff output'':%0A{{pre%7C%0A0a1,6%0A{{font color%7Cdarkgreen%7C> This is an important%0A> notice! It should%0A> therefore be located at%0A> the beginning of this%0A> document!%0A>}}%0A8,14c14%0A{{font color%7Cdarkred%7C< compress the size of the%0A< changes.%0A<%0A< This paragraph contains%0A< text that is outdated.%0A< It will be deleted in the%0A< near future.}}%0A%2D%2D%2D%0A{{font color%7Cdarkgreen%7C> compress anything.}}%0A17c17%0A{{font color%7Cdarkred%7C< check this dokument. On}}%0A%2D%2D%2D%0A{{font color%7Cdarkgreen%7C> check this document. On}}%0A24a25,28%0A{{font color%7Cdarkgreen%7C>%0A> This paragraph contains%0A> important new additions%0A> to this document.}}}}%0A%0A{{Note2}} ''Here, the diff output is shown with colors to make it easier to read. The diff utility does not produce colored output; its output is [[plain text]]. However, many tools can show the output with colors by using [[syntax highlighting]].''%0A{{col%2Dend}}|=114|+[[Less%2Dthan sign%7C|=9|+]]|=5|+[[Greater%2Dthan sign%7C|=c|+]]|=44a|+<ref>{{cite journal%7Cauthor%3DE. Myers%7Ctitle%3DAn O(ND) Difference Algorithm and Its Variations%7Cjournal%3DAlgorithmica%7Cvolume%3D1%7Cissue%3D2%7Cyear%3D1986%7Cpages%3D251–266%7Curl%3Dhttp://citeseerx.ist.psu.edu/viewdoc/summary?doi%3D10.1.1.4.6927%7Cdoi%3D10.1007/BF01840446}}</ref>|=3f|+<ref>{{cite journal%7Cauthor1%3DWebb Miller %7Cauthor2%3DEugene W. Myers %7Ctitle%3DA File Comparison Program%7Cjournal%3DSoftware &#x2014; Practice and Experience%7Cvolume%3D15%7Cissue%3D11%7Cyear%3D1985%7Cpages%3D1025&#x2013;1040%7Cdoi%3D10.1002/spe.4380151102}}</ref>|=70|+[[|=c|+]]|=1ec|+[[Ed (text editor)%7C|=b|+]]|=365|+[[BSD%7C|=1d|+]]|=82c|+<source lang%3D"diff">%0A*** /path/to/original%09timestamp%0A%2D%2D%2D /path/to/new%09timestamp%0A***************%0A*** 1,3 ****%0A%2D%2D%2D 1,9 %2D%2D%2D%2D%0A%2B This is an important%0A%2B notice! It should%0A%2B therefore be located at%0A%2B the beginning of this%0A%2B document!%0A%2B%0A  This part of the%0A  document has stayed the%0A  same from version to%0A***************%0A*** 5,20 ****%0A  be shown if it doesn't%0A  change.  Otherwise, that%0A  would not be helping to%0A! compress the size of the%0A! changes.%0A!%0A! This paragraph contains%0A! text that is outdated.%0A! It will be deleted in the%0A! near future.%0A%0A  It is important to spell%0A! check this dokument. On%0A  the other hand, a%0A  misspelled word isn't%0A  the end of the world.%0A%2D%2D%2D 11,20 %2D%2D%2D%2D%0A  be shown if it doesn't%0A  change.  Otherwise, that%0A  would not be helping to%0A! compress anything.%0A%0A  It is important to spell%0A! check this document. On%0A  the other hand, a%0A  misspelled word isn't%0A  the end of the world.%0A***************%0A*** 22,24 ****%0A%2D%2D%2D 22,28 %2D%2D%2D%2D%0A  this paragraph needs to%0A  be changed. Things can%0A  be added after it.%0A%2B%0A%2B This paragraph contains%0A%2B important new additions%0A%2B to this document.%0A</source>%0A%0A|=10c|+[[|=13|+]]|=2c|+[[|=6|+(Unix)%7Cpatch]] |=ed|+[[|=d|+]]|=c49|+<source lang%3D"diff">%0A%2D%2D%2D /path/to/original%09timestamp%0A%2B%2B%2B /path/to/new%09timestamp%0A@@ %2D1,3 %2B1,9 @@%0A%2BThis is an important%0A%2Bnotice! It should%0A%2Btherefore be located at%0A%2Bthe beginning of this%0A%2Bdocument!%0A%2B%0A This part of the%0A document has stayed the%0A same from version to%0A@@ %2D5,16 %2B11,10 @@%0A be shown if it doesn't%0A change.  Otherwise, that%0A would not be helping to%0A%2Dcompress the size of the%0A%2Dchanges.%0A%2D%0A%2DThis paragraph contains%0A%2Dtext that is outdated.%0A%2DIt will be deleted in the%0A%2Dnear future.%0A%2Bcompress anything.%0A%0A It is important to spell%0A%2Dcheck this dokument. On%0A%2Bcheck this document. On%0A the other hand, a%0A misspelled word isn't%0A the end of the world.%0A@@ %2D22,3 %2B22,7 @@%0A this paragraph needs to%0A be changed. Things can%0A be added after it.%0A%2B%0A%2BThis paragraph contains%0A%2Bimportant new additions%0A%2Bto this document.%0A</source>|=17a|+[[|=10|+]]|=13|+[[|=a|+ (software)%7CSubversion]]|=227|+<ref>http://pubs.opengroup.org/onlinepubs/9699919799/basedefs/V1_chap03.html#tag_03_205 Section 3.206</ref>|=6|+[[Patch (Unix)%7C|=5|+]]|=11e|+{{citation needed%7Cdate%3DFebruary 2015}}|=2|+[[|=5|+]]|=ca|+[[|=1|+evision |=1|+ontrol |=1|+ystem%7CRCS]]|=1|+<ref>https://www.gnu.org/software/rcs/manual/merge.html</ref>|=5|+[[|=4|+e (rev|=1|+sio|=1|+ control)%7Cmer|=1|+ing]]|=56|+[[Patch (Unix)%7C|=5|+]]|=14|+[[|=5|+]]|=5|+[[|=5|+]]|=cea|+[[|=7|+]]|=13|+[[|=5|+(|=14|+)%7CLisp]] [[programming language]]|=23|+{{colbegin}}%0A*[[cmp (Unix)%7Ccmp]]%0A*[[comm]]%0A*[[Diff%2DText]]%0A*[[diff3]]%0A*[[Kompare]]%0A*[[tkdiff]]%0A*[[WinMerge]] (Microsoft Windows)%0A*[[meld (software)%7Cmeld]]%0A*[[Pretty Diff]]%0A*[[spiff (UNIX)%7Cspiff]]%0A{{colend}}%0A%0A|=d|+{{colbegin}}%0A*[[Comparison of file comparison tools]]%0A*[[Delta encoding]]%0A*[[Difference operator]]%0A*[[Edit distance]]%0A**[[Levenshtein distance]]%0A*[[History of software configuration management]]%0A*[[Longest common subsequence problem]]%0A*[[Microsoft File Compare]]%0A*[[Revision control]]%0A*[[Software configuration management]]%0A{{colend}}%0A%0A|=a|+{{reflist%7C30em}}%0A|=1|+{{cite journal%7Cauthor%3DPaul Heckel%7Ctitle%3DA technique for isolating differences between files%7Cjournal%3DCommunications of the ACM%7Cvolume%3D21%7Cissue%3D4%7Cdate%3DApril 1978%7Cpages%3D264&#x2013;268%7Cdoi%3D10.1145/359460.359467}}|=312|+{{man%7Ccu%7Cdiff%7CSUS%7Ccompare two files}}|=4f|+[https://www.gnu.org/software/diffutils/ |=12|+]|=18|+[[|=18|+]]|=29|+[http://www.bodurov.com/JavaScriptDiff/ |=19|+]|=117|
