zΔ⚡b|+{{About%7Cthe file comparison utility%7Cdata comparisons in general%7Cdata comparison%7Cdiffs in Wikipedia%7C:help:diff%7Cother uses%7CDIFF (disambiguation){{!}}DIFF}}|=1|+{{lowercase%7Ctitle%3Ddiff}}|=1|+%0A{{|=2|+fobox software%0A%7C name                   %3D diff%0A%7C title             |=1|+    %3D diff%0A%7C s|=1|+reensh|=1|+t             %3D <!%2D%2D I|=1|+age name is enough %2D%2D>%0A%7C ca|=1|+tion                %3D %0A%7C screenshot size        %3D %0A%7C screenshot alt         %3D %0A%7C collapsible            %3D %0A%7C a|=2|+hor                 %3D [[Douglas McIlroy]]%0A%7C developer              %3D %0A%7C released               %3D {{Start date and age%7C1974}}%0A%7C latest release version %3D %0A%7C latest release date    %3D <!%2D%2D {{Start date and age%7CYYYY%7CMM%7CDD%7Cdf%3Dyes/no}} %2D%2D>%0A%7C status                 %3D %0A%7C programm|=3|+ language   %3D %0A%7C platform               %3D [[Unix]], [[Unix%2Dlike]] systems%0A%7C genre                  %3D [[Command%2Dline utility]]%0A%7C license                %3D %0A%7C website                %3D %0A%7C standard               %3D %0A%7C AsOf                   %3D %0A}}%0A%0AIn [[computing]]|=27|+[[|=f|+]]|=4d|+[[|=d|+]]|=70|+[[|=14|+]]|=1c7|+[[|=b|+]]|=16b|+[[|=5|+ (Unix)%7Cpatch]]|=1fc|+[[|=9|+]]|=7c|+[[|=f|+]]|=1d9|+[[|=18|+]]|=31|+[[Stephen C. Johnson%7C|=d|+]]|=19|+[[|=5|+]]|=5|+[[|=9|+]]|=f1|+[[|=9|+]]|=194|+[[|=a|+]]|=11|+[[|=e|+]]|=16c|+[[|=11|+]]|=169|+[[|=a|+]]|=1d|+[[|=5|+ (Unix)%7Cpatch]]|=5ef|+[[|=1a|+]]|=cc|+[[|=22|+]]|=701|+{{Col%2Dbegin}}%0A{{Col%2Dbreak%7Cwidth%3D33%25}}%0A''original'':%0A<source lang%3D"text" line>%0AThis part of the%0Adocument has stayed the%0Asame from version to%0Aversion.  It shouldn't%0Abe shown if it doesn't%0Achange.  Otherwise, that%0Awould not be helping to%0Acompress the size of the%0Achanges.%0A%0AThis paragraph contains%0Atext that is outdated.%0AIt will be deleted in the%0Anear future.%0A%0AIt is important to spell%0Acheck this dokument. On%0Athe other hand, a%0Amisspelled word isn't%0Athe end of the world.%0ANothing in the rest of%0Athis paragraph needs to%0Abe changed. Things can%0Abe added after it.%0A</source>%0A{{col%2Dbreak}}%0A''new'':%0A<source lang%3D"text" line>%0AThis is an important%0Anotice! It should%0Atherefore be located at%0Athe beginning of this%0Adocument!%0A%0AThis part of the%0Adocument has stayed the%0Asame from version to%0Aversion.  It shouldn't%0Abe shown if it doesn't%0Achange.  Otherwise, that%0Awould not be helping to%0Acompress the size of the%0Achanges.%0A%0AIt is important to spell%0Acheck this document. On%0Athe other hand, a%0Amisspelled word isn't%0Athe end of the world.%0ANothing in the rest of%0Athis paragraph needs to%0Abe changed. Things can%0Abe added after it.%0A%0AThis paragraph contains%0Aimportant new additions%0Ato this document.%0A</source>%0A{{col%2Dbreak%7Cwidth%3D33%25}}%0AThe command '''<tt>diff original new</tt>''' produces the following ''normal diff output'':%0A{{pre%7C%0A0a1,6%0A{{font color%7Cdarkgreen%7C> This is an important%0A> notice! It should%0A> therefore be located at%0A> the beginning of this%0A> document!%0A>}}%0A11,15d16%0A{{font color%7Cdarkred%7C< This paragraph contains%0A< text that is outdated.%0A< It will be deleted in the%0A< near future.%0A<}}%0A17c18%0A{{font color%7Cdarkred%7C< check this dokument. On}}%0A%2D%2D%2D%0A{{font color%7Cdarkgreen%7C> check this document. On}}%0A24a26,29%0A{{font color%7Cdarkgreen%7C>%0A> This paragraph contains%0A> important new additions%0A> to this document.}}}}%0A%0A{{Note2}} ''Here, the diff output is shown with colors to make it easier to read. The diff utility does not produce colored output; its output is [[plain text]]. However, many tools can show the output with colors by using [[syntax highlighting]].''%0A{{col%2Dend}}|=10f|+[[Less%2Dthan sign%7C|=9|+]]|=5|+[[Greater%2Dthan sign%7C|=c|+]]|=899|+[[Ed (text editor)%7C|=b|+]]|=274|+{{code%7Clang%3Dbash%7Cprintf "w\nq\n" >> mydiff}}|=66|+{{code%7Clang%3Dbash%7Ced %2Ds original < mydiff}}|=15|-1|=9|+[[BSD%7C|=1d|+]]|=39e|+[[|=5|+ (Unix)%7Cpatch]]|=478|+<source lang%3D"diff">%0A*** /path/to/original%09timestamp%0A%2D%2D%2D /path/to/new%09timestamp%0A***************%0A*** 1,3 ****%0A%2D%2D%2D 1,9 %2D%2D%2D%2D%0A%2B This is an important%0A%2B notice! It should%0A%2B therefore be located at%0A%2B the beginning of this%0A%2B document!%0A%2B%0A  This part of the%0A  document has stayed the%0A  same from version to%0A***************%0A*** 8,20 ****%0A  compress the size of the%0A  changes.%0A%0A%2D This paragraph contains%0A%2D text that is outdated.%0A%2D It will be deleted in the%0A%2D near future.%0A%0A  It is important to spell%0A! check this dokument. On%0A  the other hand, a%0A  misspelled word isn't%0A  the end of the world.%0A%2D%2D%2D 14,21 %2D%2D%2D%2D%0A  compress the size of the%0A  changes.%0A%0A  It is important to spell%0A! check this document. On%0A  the other hand, a%0A  misspelled word isn't%0A  the end of the world.%0A***************%0A*** 22,24 ****%0A%2D%2D%2D 23,29 %2D%2D%2D%2D%0A  this paragraph needs to%0A  be changed. Things can%0A  be added after it.%0A%2B%0A%2B This paragraph contains%0A%2B important new additions%0A%2B to this document.%0A</source>%0A%0A|=10b|+[[|=13|+]]|=2cf|+[[Header (computing)%7C|=6|+]]|=149|+[[|=9|+]]|=27|+[[|=a|+]]|=c9|+[[|=7|+]]|=54|+[[#Context format%7C|=5|+]]|=7d2|+<source lang%3D"diff">%0A%2D%2D%2D /path/to/original%09timestamp%0A%2B%2B%2B /path/to/new%09timestamp%0A@@ %2D1,3 %2B1,9 @@%0A%2BThis is an important%0A%2Bnotice! It should%0A%2Btherefore be located at%0A%2Bthe beginning of this%0A%2Bdocument!%0A%2B%0A This part of the%0A document has stayed the%0A same from version to%0A@@ %2D8,13 %2B14,8 @@%0A compress the size of the%0A changes.%0A%0A%2DThis paragraph contains%0A%2Dtext that is outdated.%0A%2DIt will be deleted in the%0A%2Dnear future.%0A%2D%0A It is important to spell%0A%2Dcheck this dokument. On%0A%2Bcheck this document. On%0A the other hand, a%0A misspelled word isn't%0A the end of the world.%0A@@ %2D22,3 %2B23,7 @@%0A this paragraph needs to%0A be changed. Things can%0A be added after it.%0A%2B%0A%2BThis paragraph contains%0A%2Bimportant new additions%0A%2Bto this document.%0A</source>|=17a|+[[|=10|+]]|=13|+[[|=a|+ (software)%7CSubversion]]|=3cc|+{{citation needed%7Cdate%3DFebruary 2015}}|=137|+[[merge (revision control)%7C|=7|+]]|=56|+[[Patch (Unix)%7C|=5|+]]|=82c|+[[Computer |=4|+%7Cfile]]|=56|-1|=36|+ name%3D"dontcallme"|=18|-1|+gi|=1|-b|+hub|=5|+dontc|=1|-8|+llmedom|=1|-7|+spiff|=1|-2|+ti|=1|+l|=2|-a|+spiff|=8|-4|=1|-2|+on|=1|-2|+cal|=1|+m|=1|-2|+do|=1|-1|=1|-1|=1|-7|+m|=1e|-11|=4|-12|=18|-2|+s|=1|-4|+a|=1|+k|=1|-3|+verfl|=1|-2|+w.|=1|-6|=3|-5|+a/1489107/2291035|=1|+da|=1|-3|=2|-5|+2009%2D09%2D28|=8|+Davi|=1|-2|+e%7C|=1|-3|+it|=1|-1|=1|-2|+%3Ds|=1|+a|=1|+k|=1|-1|+verflow|=96|+oc|=1|-1|=1|+ion|=1|-7|+UK|=10|+last%3DNachbar%7C|=10|-c|=1e|+# and [[Space (punctuation)%7Cwhitespace]]<ref name%3D"dontcallme"/><ref name%3D"hpux"/>%0A|=64|+[[Telcordia Technologies%7C|=8|+]]|=204|+[[|=f|+]]|=53|+[[|=c|+]]|=2|+[[|=7|+]]|=2|+[[|=8|+]]|=5|+[[|=5|+(|=14|+)%7CLisp]] [[programming language]]|=23|+{{colbegin}}%0A*[[cmp (Unix)%7Ccmp]]%0A*[[comm]]%0A*[[Diff%2DText]]%0A*[[diff3]]%0A*[[Kompare]]%0A*[[tkdiff]]%0A*[[WinMerge]] (Microsoft Windows)%0A*[[meld (software)%7Cmeld]]%0A*[[Pretty Diff]]%0A*[[spiff (UNIX)%7Cspiff]]%0A{{colend}}%0A%0A|=d|+{{colbegin}}%0A*[[Comparison of file comparison tools]]%0A*[[Delta encoding]]%0A*[[Difference operator]]%0A*[[Edit distance]]%0A**[[Levenshtein distance]]%0A*[[History of software configuration management]]%0A*[[Longest common subsequence problem]]%0A*[[Microsoft File Compare]]%0A*[[Revision control]]%0A*[[Software configuration management]]%0A{{colend}}%0A%0A|=a|+{{reflist%7C30em}}|=2|+{{cite journal%7Cauthor%3DPaul Heckel%7Ctitle%3DA technique for isolating differences between files%7Cjournal%3DCommunications of the ACM%7Cvolume%3D21%7Cissue%3D4%7Cdate%3DApril 1978%7Cpages%3D