zΔ⚡b|=38ca|+[[BSD%7C|=1d|+]]|=2f|+({{code%7C%2Dc}}) |=3d|+ ({{code%7C%2Dr}}),|=315|+[[|=5|+ (Unix)%7Cpatch]]|=198|+"{{code%7C!}}"|=48|+{{code%7C%2B}}|=33|+[[|=5|+ (punctuation)%7Cspace]]|=74|+[[|=a|+]]|=173|+{{code%7Cdiff %2Dc original new}}|=20|+<source lang%3D"diff">%0A*** /path/to/original%09timestamp%0A%2D%2D%2D /path/to/new%09timestamp%0A***************%0A*** 1,3 ****%0A%2D%2D%2D 1,9 %2D%2D%2D%2D%0A%2B This is an important%0A%2B notice! It should%0A%2B therefore be located at%0A%2B the beginning of this%0A%2B document!%0A%2B%0A  This part of the%0A  document has stayed the%0A  same from version to%0A***************%0A*** 8,20 ****%0A  compress the size of the%0A  changes.%0A%0A%2D This paragraph contains%0A%2D text that is outdated.%0A%2D It will be deleted in the%0A%2D near future.%0A%0A  It is important to spell%0A! check this dokument. On%0A  the other hand, a%0A  misspelled word isn't%0A  the end of the world.%0A%2D%2D%2D 14,21 %2D%2D%2D%2D%0A  compress the size of the%0A  changes.%0A%0A  It is important to spell%0A! check this document. On%0A  the other hand, a%0A  misspelled word isn't%0A  the end of the world.%0A***************%0A*** 22,24 ****%0A%2D%2D%2D 23,29 %2D%2D%2D%2D%0A  this paragraph needs to%0A  be changed. Things can%0A  be added after it.%0A%2B%0A%2B This paragraph contains%0A%2B important new additions%0A%2B to this document.%0A</source>%0A%0A|=fd|+"<code>%2Du</code>" [[|=13|+]]|=2c|+[[|=6|+(Unix)%7Cpatch]] |=ed|+[[|=d|+]]|=55|+[[|=10|+]]|=23|+[[GNU%7C|=b|+]]|=ef|+[[Header (computing)%7C|=6|+]]|=151|+[[|=9|+]]|=27|+[[|=a|+]]|=c9|+[[|=7|+]]|=54|+[[#Context format%7C|=5|+]]|=52c|+[[|=12|+]]|=a|+<ref>[https://www.gnu.org/software/diffutils/manual/html_node/Sections.html 2.2.3 Showing Which Sections Differences Are in], GNU diffutils manual</ref>|=bf|+<ref>[http://www.artima.com/weblogs/viewpost.jsp?thread%3D164293 Unified Diff Format] by [[Guido van Rossum]], June 14, 2006</ref>|=4fb|+[[|=10|+]]|=13|+[[|=a|+ (software)%7CSubversion]]|=227|+<ref>http://pubs.opengroup.org/onlinepubs/9699919799/basedefs/V1_chap03.html#tag_03_205 Section 3.206</ref>|=6|+[[Patch (Unix)%7C|=5|+]]|=11e|+{{citation needed%7Cdate%3DFebruary 2015}}|=2|+[[|=5|+]]|=ca|+[[|=1|+evision |=1|+ontrol |=1|+ystem%7CRCS]]|=1|+<ref>https://www.gnu.org/software/rcs/manual/merge.html</ref>|=5|+[[|=4|+e (rev|=1|+sio|=1|+ control)%7Cmer|=1|+ing]]|=56|+[[Patch (Unix)%7C|=5|+]]|=14|+[[|=5|+]]|=5|+[[|=5|+]]|=114|+[[|=5|+]]<ref>https://www.gnu.org/software/wdiff/</ref>|=118|+<ref>https://www.colordiff.org/</ref>|=8c|+<ref>{{cite journal%7Clast1%3DHorwitz%7Cfirst1%3DSusan%7Ctitle%3DIdentifying the semantic and textual differences between two versions of a program%7Cjournal%3DACM SIGPLAN Notices%7Cdate%3DJune 1990%7Cvolume%3D25%7Cissue%3D6%7Cpages%3D234–245%7Cdoi%3D10.1145/93548.93574%7Curl%3Dhttp://www.cs.wisc.edu/wpis/papers/sigplan90.ps%7Cciteseerx%3D10.1.1.49.3377}}</ref><ref>{{cite journal%7Clast1%3DYang%7Cfirst1%3DWuu%7Ctitle%3DIdentifying syntactic differences between two programs%7Cjournal%3DSoftware: Practice and Experience%7Cdate%3DJuly 1991%7Cvolume%3D21%7Cissue%3D7%7Cpages%3D739–755%7Cdoi%3D10.1002/spe.4380210706%7Cciteseerx%3D10.1.1.13.9377}}</ref><ref>Grass. Cdiff: A syntax directed Diff for C%2B%2B programs. Proceedings USENIX C%2B%2B Conf., pp. 181%2D193, 1992</ref>|=28|+<ref>Compare%2B%2B, http://www.coodesoft.com/</ref><ref>SmartDifferencer, http://www.semanticdesigns.com/Products/SmartDifferencer</ref><ref>Cheney, Austin. ''Pretty Diff %2D Documentation''. http://prettydiff.com/documentation.php</ref>|=1d|+<ref>''DaisyDiff'', https://code.google.com/p/daisydiff/</ref>|=3b|+<ref>''xmldiffpatch'', http://msdn.microsoft.com/en%2Dus/library/aa302294.aspx</ref><ref>''xmldiffmerge'', http://www.alphaworks.ibm.com/tech/xmldiffmerge</ref>|=17|+[[Computer |=4|+%7Cfile]]|=56|-1|=32|+<ref name%3D"dontcallme">{{cite web%7Curl%3Dhttps://github.com/dontcallmedom/spiff%7Ctitle%3Dspiff%7Cauthor%3Ddontcallmedotcom%7Caccessdate%3D2013%2D06%2D16}}</ref><ref>{{cite web%7Curl%3Dhttps://stackoverflow.com/a/1489107/2291035%7Cdate%3D2009%2D09%2D28%7Cauthor%3DDavide%7Ctitle%3Dstackoverflow%7Caccessdate%3D2013%2D06%2D16}}</ref><ref name%3D"hpux">{{cite web%7Curl%3Dhttp://hpux.connect.org.uk/hppd/hpux/Text/spiff%2D1.0/%7Ctitle%3DHP%2DUX Porting and Archiving%7Clocation%3DUK%7Cfirst%3DDaniel W%7Clast%3DNachbar%7Cdate%3D1999%2D12%2D01%7Caccessdate%3D2013%2D06%2D13}}</ref>|=7|+[[Space (punctuation)%7C|=a|-1|+]]<ref name%3D"dontcallme"/><ref name%3D"hpux"/>|=51|+[[|=3|+ (Unix)%7Ccmp]]|=2|+[[Telcordia Technologies%7C|=8|+]]|=1c|+<ref name%3D"dontcallme"/><ref name%3D"hpux"/>|=4|+[[|=4|+]]|=4e|+<ref>{{cite web%7Curl%3Dhttp://www.math.utah.edu/cgi%2Dbin/man2html.cgi?/usr/local/man/man1/spiff.1%7Ctitle%3DSPIFF 1%7Cdate%3D1988%2D02%2D02%7Caccessdate%3D2013%2D06%2D16}}</ref><ref>{{cite web%7Curl%3Dhttp://hpux.connect.org.uk/hppd/hpux/Text/spiff%2D1.0/man.html%7Ctitle%3DMan page%7Clocation%3DUK%7Cfirst%3DDaniel W%7Clast%3DNachbar%7Cdate%3D1988%2D02%2D02%7Caccessdate%3D2013%2D06%2D16}}</ref>|=16|+[[|=f|+]]|=33|+[[|=1|+ (programming language)%7CC]]|=2|+[[|=c|+]]|=2|+[[|=7|+]]|=2|+[[|=8|+]]|=5|+[[|=5|+(|=14|+)%7CLisp]] [[programming language]]|=6|+Free file comparison tools%3D%3D%0A{{colbegin}}%0A*[[cmp (Unix)%7Ccmp]]%0A*[[comm]]%0A*[[Diff%2DText]]%0A*[[diff3]]%0A*[[Kompare]]%0A*[[tkdiff]]%0A*[[WinMerge]] (Microsoft Windows)%0A*[[meld (software)%7Cmeld]]%0A*[[Pretty Diff]]%0A*[[spiff (UNIX)%7Cspiff]]%0A{{colend}}%0A%0A%3D%3DSee also%3D%3D%0A{{colbegin}}%0A*[[Comparison of file comparison tools]]%0A*[[Delta encoding]]%0A*[[Difference operator]]%0A*[[Edit distance]]%0A**[[Levenshtein distance]]%0A*[[History of software configuration management]]%0A*[[Longest common subsequence problem]]%0A*[[Microsoft File Compare]]%0A*[[Revision control]]%0A*[[Software configuration management]]%0A{{colend}}%0A%0A%3D%3D|=c|+%0A{{Reflist%7C30em}}%0A|=658|
